  "goal": "Question: Can this contract and implementation give Prime a faithful bounded desk view without confusing historical observations, accepted work, terminal completion, held work, missing records or worker availability? What are the smallest useful corrections?\nWhy: A convenient morning brief is harmful if it quietly converts unknown or stale data into current authority. We need evidence about those failure modes before adoption.",
